    "title":  "Band-9 Samples: In general, do you find it easy to read maps? [Why/Why not?]",
    "slug":  "cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9",
    "link":  "https://engnovate.com/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9/",
    "date":  "2023-05-13T10:32:13",
    "content":  "\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eThis post contains ideas and band-9 sample answers (audio included) for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eCambridge IELTS 17 Academic Speaking Part 1 Question 4 Test 4\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;question:\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026#8220;In general, do you find it easy to read maps? [Why/Why not?]\u0026#8221;\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 1: Easy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-1.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-1.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eIn general, I find reading maps to be a piece of cake. My innate spatial awareness and keen sense of direction enable me to effortlessly interpret geographic information, which I attribute to years of practice during my travels.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 2: Easy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-2.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-2.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eGenerally, I find interpreting maps to be a relatively straightforward task. My aptitude for spatial orientation and cartographic literacy allows me to efficiently navigate unfamiliar territories. As a result, I consider this skill to be an invaluable asset in my day-to-day life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 3: Easy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-3.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-3.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eYes, I find it quite facile to read maps, mainly due to my exposure to various cartographic representations. As a geography aficionado, I\u0026#8217;ve honed my skills in deciphering topographic details and navigating unfamiliar terrains.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 4: Easy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-4.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-4.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eBy and large, I consider myself adept at comprehending maps, primarily stemming from my voracious curiosity for exploring new destinations. This proclivity has honed my skills in scrutinizing various cartographic layouts, expediting the process of accurately deducing spatial relationships.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 5: Hard\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-5.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-5.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eI must admit, I find reading maps to be an arduous task. Despite my best efforts, I often struggle with disentangling the myriad of lines and landmarks, leading to a proclivity for relying on digital navigation tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 6: Hard\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-6.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-6.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eRegrettably, I do not find it easy to read maps. I\u0026#8217;m like a fish out of water when faced with complex cartographic images, as my spatial intelligence leaves much to be desired. Consequently, I prefer to seek assistance from technology or fellow travelers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 7: Hard\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-7.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-7.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eRegretfully, I have a hard time deciphering maps. Despite my eagerness to explore new places, I find myself in a labyrinth of confusion when confronted with cartographic complexities. Therefore, I customarily resort to the assistance of GPS devices or locals to guide me.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 8: Hard\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-8.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-8.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eOn the whole, I perceive map reading as a relatively demanding exercise. The labyrinthine nature of geographical layouts and the plethora of symbols can be quite confounding, thus impeding my ease in understanding them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 9: Moderate\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-9.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-9.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eIn general, I would describe my ability to read maps as somewhat proficient. While cartographic interpretation doesn\u0026#8217;t pose a significant challenge, it also doesn\u0026#8217;t come effortlessly. It ultimately depends on the complexity of the map and the context in which I am utilizing it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 10: Moderate\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-female-voice-10.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-speaking-part-1-question-4-test-4-samples-band-9-male-voice-10.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eMy experience with map reading is rather ambivalent. I\u0026#8217;m neither a seasoned cartographer nor a complete novice when it comes to deciphering geographic representations. The ease of reading maps tends to fluctuate depending on various factors such as scale, symbols, and orientation.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
    "excerpt":  "\u003cp\u003eThis post contains ideas and band-9 sample answers (audio included) for the\u0026nbsp;Cambridge IELTS 17 Academic Speaking Part 1 Question 4 Test 4\u0026nbsp;question: \u0026#8220;In general, do you find it easy to read maps? [Why/Why not?]\u0026#8221; Sample 1: Easy In general, I find reading maps to be a piece of cake. My innate spatial awareness and keen [\u0026hellip;]\u003c/p\u003e\n"
}
